    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.21_ologs_and_typed_english.chapters.01_olog_as_typed_english.sections.01_olog_definition_spivak_kent.concrete_anchor_O_eng#papertwentyoneologcategory" .
silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_01_olog_as_typed_english_sections_01_olog_definition_spivak_kent_concrete_anchor_O_eng#papertwentyoneologcategory silm:hasLongDescription "The PaperTwentyOneOlogCategory is O_eng is paper 21's typed-English olog category, containing boxes such as ``a domestic cat', ``a body mass quality', ``a sleeping process', and ``a duration measurement', with verb arrows such as ``has as body mass', ``participates in', and ``is measured by'. It is the finitely-presented category whose generators and relations are stated in typed English." .
